        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is a falling blocks puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare deliveries by aligning underwear blocks of the same type and connecting them with a box block of the same color to make them disappear! The game ends when no more blocks can be placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover Marathon mode, a staple of games in this genre. Strategically place your blocks to fill as many boxes as possible and achieve the highest score during a session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This mode can be played by up to 3 players, either cooperatively—where everyone contributes to the team score—or competitively, where each player must collect as many panties as possible to stay in the game the longest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Objective mode</i> offers limited rounds where you must fill a set number of boxes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can cooperate with 1 or 2 other players to reach a shared goal, or compete to see who reaches their objective first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is perfect for relaxing or enjoying a friendly moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is a falling blocks puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare deliveries by aligning underwear blocks of the same type and connecting them with a box block of the same color to make them disappear! The game ends when no more blocks can be placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover Marathon mode, a staple of games in this genre. Strategically place your blocks to fill as many boxes as possible and achieve the highest score during a session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This mode can be played by up to 3 players, either cooperatively—where everyone contributes to the team score—or competitively, where each player must collect as many panties as possible to stay in the game the longest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Objective mode</i> offers limited rounds where you must fill a set number of boxes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can cooperate with 1 or 2 other players to reach a shared goal, or compete to see who reaches their objective first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is perfect for relaxing or enjoying a friendly moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
